 {"name": "CategoryTheory.GrpObj.pointTranslation", "kind": "def", "signature": "def pointTranslation (x y : \ud835\udfd9_ C \u27f6 G) : G \u2245 G", "doc": "**The translation carrying the point `x` to the point `y`**: the automorphism `(\u00b7 \u22c5 x\u207b\u00b9 y)` of a group object, `mulRight x \u207b\u00b9 \u226a\u226b mulRight y`.  This is the homogeneity automorphism mathlib uses inline in `Group/Smooth.lean`, packaged.", "library": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild", "file": "MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild/AlgebraicJacobian/AbelianVariety/Translation.lean", "line": 75}
