+{"name": "AlgebraicJacobian.RigidEngine.aeval_apply_of_ringHom", "kind": "lemma", "signature": "lemma aeval_apply_of_ringHom (\u03c6 : k[X] \u2192+* A) (e : Module.End k A) (he : \u2200 a : A, e a = \u03c6 X * a) (hC : \u2200 (c : k) (a : A), c \u2022 a = \u03c6 (C c) * a) (p : k[X]) (a : A) : Polynomial.aeval e p a = \u03c6 p * a", "doc": "**The polynomial action through a ring map.** If `e` acts as multiplication by `\u03c6 X` and the `k`-scalars act as multiplication by `\u03c6 \u2218 C`, then the `aeval`-action of any polynomial `p` on `A` is multiplication by `\u03c6 p`. * Provenance: CUSTOM.", "library": "Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild", "file": "MainProjects/Algebraic-Jacobian-Challenge-Rebuild/AlgebraicJacobian/Cohomology/RigidEngine4AEval.lean", "line": 101}
